       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. P.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 PRICE PIC 9(4)V99 VALUE 19.99.
       01 QTY   PIC 9(3) VALUE 3.
       01 RATE  PIC 9(3) VALUE 100.
       01 R     PIC $$,$$9.99.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           COMPUTE R = PRICE * QTY / RATE.
           DISPLAY "PCT=" R.
           STOP RUN.
